course: dictionary
lesson: 11066
title: Weighing: one word, several meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. «Weighing» is the -ing form of weigh, and the words around it show which meaning you need. Look for clues such as scales, kilograms, or choices.
explain: «She is weighing the flour.» Here weighing means measuring how heavy something is. In «a parcel weighing 2 kilograms», the number is the clue: weighing means having a weight of 2 kilograms.
explain: «Weighing up the choices» has nothing to do with scales. It means thinking carefully about the good and bad points before you decide. Check by swapping in a meaning: "thinking carefully about" fits the sentence, but "measuring" does not.
fact: Weigh means to measure how heavy something is.
fact: «Weighing» can be a verb, as in «She is weighing the flour», or a noun, as in «the weighing of the babies».
fact: «Weighing up» means comparing the good and bad points before you choose.
fact: «Weighing on my mind» means worrying me.
fact: Clue words such as scales, grams and kilograms tell you the meaning is about weight.
exercise: In «She is weighing the flour», what does weighing mean? | Pouring the flour away | *Measuring how heavy the flour is | Sieving the flour fine | Stirring the flour into a cake
exercise: In «a parcel weighing 2 kilograms», what does weighing mean? | *Having a weight of 2 kilograms | Opening the parcel | Wrapping the parcel in paper | Carrying the parcel upstairs
exercise: «She spent a long time weighing up the choices.» What does weighing up mean? | *Thinking carefully about the good and bad points | Shouting at the choices | Forgetting the choices | Measuring the choices on scales
test: In «weighing on my mind», what does weighing mean? | Measuring my weight | Being carried in my bag | *Worrying me | Pressing down on my head
test: In «Among 9 coins with one heavier fake, a balance finds the fake in 2 weighings», what is a weighing? | A coin that is fake | *One time of using the scales to compare | A kind of shop | Two coins in a bag
exam: In «Lavoisier showed by careful weighing that matter is not lost», what is careful weighing? | Burning things carefully | *Measuring things carefully to find out their weight | Lifting heavy objects | Naming new gases
